# ============================================================
# Backup ONLY the plans/configs/scripts (small text files).
# Do NOT commit huge AI files — GitHub has a 100MB/file limit
# and these are re-downloadable or stored elsewhere (see README).
# ============================================================

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# AI models / weights (re-download from HuggingFace)
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.gguf
*.onnx

# Trained LoRA output (back up to HuggingFace/Drive instead — see README)
01_character/output/
01_character/dataset/            # your personal photos — keep private/offline

# Generated media (regenerable, huge)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif

# Working folders fill with big media — but the *.md/.csv guides inside them
# must stay tracked, so we rely on the file-EXTENSION ignores above (mp4, wav,
# png, etc.) instead of ignoring whole folders. Do NOT ignore folders by name
# here, or git will drop the guide files inside them.

# But DO keep the guide/markdown/csv/yaml in those folders:
!**/*.md
!**/*.csv
!**/*.yaml
!**/*.yml
!**/*.txt
